==Strategy==
The main threat in this stage is Lord Gravey, so make sure you have some good [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] units.

Utilizing [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat's]] weaken can help keep your frontline alive, [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris/Cyborg Cat]] can help keep the peons away and deal damage, and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] (true formed to Housewife if able) will help to kill the zombies and deal damage to Lord Gravey. Any wave attackers you have (such as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs]]) to help clear peons will make this stage much easier. Backliners like [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun]] can help deal damage, as well as any anti-zombie ubers you may have.

[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can deal loads of damage to both the faces and Lord Gravey if timed correctly, and can even kill Gravey and move to the base before he revives, which should mean victory.

